            "detailed_description": "<strong>Hex Empire 3</strong> is unique turn-based strategy game where you can fulfill all of your deepest dreams of becoming a bloodthirsty dictator. All without even taking your fluffy slippers off your feet!<br><br><strong>What's special?</strong> The game is purely deterministic - no randomness (except for the randomly generated maps) - the same action will always give the same result.<br><strong>No luck needed, only brains!</strong><br><br><strong>SINGLEPLAYER MODE</strong> - wage wars on thousands of map!<br><strong>PARTY MODE</strong> - play multiplayer games on single computer!<br><strong>MAP EDITOR</strong> - create own worlds just to destroy!<br><strong>THOUSANDS OF GENERATED MAPS</strong> - you can play forever!<br><strong>CAMPAIGNS</strong> - coming soon!<br><strong>NETWORKED MULTIPLAYER</strong> - coming soon!",
