                        "recommendationid": "232998735",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561199062962551",
                            "num_reviews": 1,
                            "playtime_forever": 6858,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 130,
                            "playtime_at_review": 6632,
                            "last_played": 1793337347
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Game is great for casual players like myself who like strategy war games but with now limited time with work and family. I fell in love with the OG web version and I love the custom map building too. You can make the game harder by finding maps with a difficult starting location for your nation or making your own custom map where you put yourself at a disadvantage. A long, challenging game would take me about 90 minutes but most games usually go about 45-60 minutes. I enjoy the endless choice of maps and it gives me the satisfying feeling of conquering a map similar to what I'd get from a traditional strategy game. I hope a more expansive and updated version of this game is made someday.",
